MID_Roster_Dislike_Kou_001: Dagda el Magno, dioses,\nella misma.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Kou_002: Ella misma.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Tro_001: Dagda el Magno, el Templo,\nVritra.
